data: {"id": "65f91c17dd16496d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1066", "run_id": "65f91c17dd16496d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 仍存在于 API Server，处于 Terminating 状态**\n   - `kubectl get pod` 能查到对象，符合 TerminatingStuck 前提。\n   - `phase: Running`（YAML），但 `describe` 报告 `status: Terminating`，这是 k8s 在 deletionTimestamp 存在但容器仍在运行时出现的\"相/状态\"差异，核心信号是 **deletionTimestamp 已存在**。\n\n2. **deletionTimestamp 与终止窗口**\n   - `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T08:04:45Z`\n   - `terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 3900` (65分钟)\n   - Pod 创建于 `06:59:37Z`，删除时间戳在约 65 分钟后设置。\n\n3. **Finalizers**\n   - `finalizers: <none>` — **排除了 finalizer 未完成导致卡死 的", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789369234430, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

